    "updated_at": "2025-08-27T15:40:53Z",
    "body": "> There currently isn't any way to pass sensor values through from Steam, so effectively the Steam Virtual Gamepad does not have sensor support.\n\n[after experimenting with it myself](https://github.com/AL2009man/SDL/tree/SteamInputSensor-Test), it's indeed the case. I believe it's still worth doing, but might require communicating with the Steam Input folks to add SDL Motion Sensor Passthru support.",
