    "updated_at": "2025-11-10T18:52:41Z",
    "body": "[Looks like Microsoft started to push MS GameInput a bit further with the October 2025 GDK Video](https://youtu.be/xD7xrh8DHjQ).\n\nmight be a good time to start looking into adding SDL Gamepad Sensor Passthru support into SteamInput, while potentially preparing for a very slow wise of games that might ship with GameInput ver.2 or GameInput ver.0",
